  "message.slashblade_neomotions.charge": "Great Sword stage %s | Charge Lv.%s | %s/%s",
  "message.slashblade_neomotions.help": "Manual in main hand + blade in off hand: Use to equip, Sneak + Use to restore. Great Sword Attack: overhead > sweep > rising slash. Hold Use to charge, release to strike; hold Use during recovery to queue strong and true charge. Charge levels at 16/31/46 ticks; 60 ticks overcharges and auto-releases. Tap Attack during charge to prepare your SA, then release Use; native charge windows apply, 60-tick timeout cancels. Tap Sneak during charge to tackle; keep holding Use for the next stage or Attack for leaping sweep. Attack after strong charged slash for strong sweep. Dual Blade Attack: Double Slash > Double Slash Return Stroke > Circle Slash > Demon Flurry I > Sixfold Demon Slash. Sneak + Attack: spin; add forward/back for Lunging Strike/Rising Slash. Air: Jumping Doubleslash, followed by landing recovery. Hold/release Use for your SA; undercharge or 54-tick timeout cancels. Prototypes: Creative, crafting, or /neomotions blade greatsword / dualblade.; Switch Axe: /neomotions blade switchaxe; R morph, Sneak+R burst/discharge.",
